      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "The Figma plugin bundle is the default build target and is written to\n`build/plugin/`. The optional release packaging command remains explicit.\nFixture source data for cleanup and packaging tests is created under\n`resources/test-workspaces/` and removed afterward. The syntax-compatibility\ncheck builds its temporary plugin bundle under `build/` and removes it after\ninspection. Neither build nor these tests starts Figma or runs the plugin.\n"
    }
